{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0054_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7cc63fd4935488a5e34e9bd11e0da901805aa4e4d7797a4665920ec2b67a0956", "ja": "（ステージは終わったが、お客さんたちの声援は\n鳴り止まない。このままアンコールに……）", "zh": "（表演虽然结束了，观众仍持续欢呼。\n就这样进入安可时间……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0054_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "f3ee587111e921f2ddf82154f27ee3060c6e291b17cfcae669bc409fc9914726", "ja": "やぁ～んっ、メモメモっ！\nありさメモはどこですか～！？", "zh": "讨厌啦～笔记笔记！\n亚利沙笔记在哪里～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0054_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0f80ca567dd81c6d14a80ea31ec4a8e2dc41c5d34331c7a144aa206ecf1933c2", "ja": "どうしたんだ亜利沙、そんなに慌てて……\nアンコールだけど、行けそうか？", "zh": "怎么了？亚利沙，看你手忙脚乱的……\n要准备安可了，你能上吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0054_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "1755d13877ffd012dcbb93cba2e466c95c6308166f31a6cb3d90307842cc2fa3", "ja": "はいっ、もちろんです！　……じゃなくて！\n{$P$}さんも探してください！", "zh": "好的！当然没问题……不对！\n{$P$}先生，你也帮忙来找吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0054_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "a795a20125f2a8a4a267170e7e4e4fe2e34a1987e83d14eed69b03246f688077", "ja": "ありさの命より大事なありさメモが、\n見つからないんです～っ！", "zh": "比亚利沙的性命还要重要的亚利沙笔记\n不见了啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0054_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2dad6a6016bdacbea8f5d3698b91d6b899dcbdb56d7b91a11af8566fad82eda4", "ja": "いや、命のほうが大事だと思うけど……\nというか、どうして今、メモが必要なんだ？", "zh": "不是，我觉得你的性命比较重要吧……\n况且，为什么现在要用到笔记呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0054_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "28f4b21d8d1a89ccbca543f0d53a308469f69b47edafd483ff660fcec0801ad5", "ja": "ありさ、今のステージ、すごくすごく感動して……\nこの感動を、残しておかなくちゃって思ったんです！", "zh": "刚才的表演让亚利沙非常非常感动……\n亚利沙必须把这份感动纪录下来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0054_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "1e0c4cfc4cc73cbe5906d7f06fb6c91e3fd4664f256b42752e81350a55524497", "ja": "だから{$P$}さん、メモを！\n早くしないと、記憶が飛んでいっちゃいますよ～！", "zh": "所以说，{$P$}先生，请帮忙找笔记！\n要是不快一点，记忆就要飞走啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0054_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ec9d54dac9483c6f0278bf9cc228be371105dc26789d521c766e34faa3b53446", "ja": "なるほど、そういう事だったのか。\nだったら亜利沙、今すぐステージに戻ろう！", "zh": "原来是这么一回事。\n这样的话，亚利沙，你现在马上回舞台上吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0054_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "6fb89d3ea3257d532fdb7b8aaea1c49435d712858f522284b8b960af881ea591", "ja": "ふぇっ！？　どど、どうしてですかぁ！？", "zh": "什么！？这这、这是为什么呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0054_1010_p", "source_sha256": "083d1f7e5da5adc0e419d4502ebd40a2a7b24f15633e2c4500ba059aca71b077", "ja": "もちろん、ライブが生物だからだよ。\nいや、生き物と言ってもいいかな？", "zh": "当然是因为演唱会是生物啊。\n不对，应该要说演唱会是活的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0054_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c272586041e88bdd519fd4b616f5299c0fcc97eb7f855ba73700ffb448d2cef7", "ja": "メモばかり取ってたら、亜利沙のアンコールを\n待ってるファンの人たちの、最高の笑顔を見逃すぞ！", "zh": "亚利沙，要是你只顾著作笔记，\n就会错过等候你安可的粉丝脸上灿烂的笑容了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0054_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "fcfcad69e09bd692e438146e4dddd7e36c5b58f0101d3662cd4f3dbd213ac118", "ja": "はっ！？　そうでした、ライブは生物……\nそして今は、アンコール前！！", "zh": "啊！？原来如此，演唱会是生物……\n而现在是安可之前！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0054_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "abb8f057bff1dd3490858a4a0e7a249a9c839a0592adcbf2dc291ff87d21670a", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nありさ、大事なコトを忘れてました！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n亚利沙忘记一件很重要的事了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0054_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "62ae22c573f3469dd6f86d76127acff6ecfda47c21308b3cd1762c3bdfa28be7", "ja": "アンコールで、大好きなアイドルちゃんが戻ってきて\nくれた時の嬉しさ……ありさ、よく知ってますっ！", "zh": "看到最喜欢的偶像宝贝在安可中\n回到舞台时有多么开心……亚利沙非常清楚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0054_1015_p", "source_sha256": "dc4cbbc344a21ef969aa7199a5d91af095781ebe7727a6c61557c5725227891c", "ja": "そうだな。それじゃ、行ってこい！\nファンのみんなが、亜利沙を待ってるぞ！", "zh": "没错。那就快上场吧！\n粉丝们都在等你啊，亚利沙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0054_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "986c21820f2aee54653bb0791ab8da14e68d8dc8a9387fca92620901be6f45d6", "ja": "はい！　ありさ、全力でいってきますっ！\nコール&レスポンスならまかせてください！", "zh": "好的！亚利沙会全力以赴！\n交给亚利沙来带动气氛吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0054_1017_028ari", "source_sha256": "3446ae9a32f9a4b30ddc1f4c35b09d6cdcc146e18fcd15c85da0360636e3bcbb", "ja": "思いっきり盛り上げてきちゃいますよぉ～！\nムフフ……♪", "zh": "亚利沙要嗨翻全场啰～！\n唔呼呼……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
